      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Salamanca_(Madrid)",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "The 1857 Plan Castro, approved by Minister Claudio Moyano, marked the first official expansion of Salamanca beyond its medieval limits.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        10
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Salamanca_(Madrid)",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Don José de Salamanca y Mayol, the 1st Marquess of Salamanca, lent his name to the district after championing its urban development.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        12
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
